<title>UK: UK's Debonair prices new shares at 4.50 stg.</title>
<headline>UK's Debonair prices new shares at 4.50 stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British airline Debonair Holdings Plc, specialising in discounted fares, said on Thursday it had priced its institutional offering of 5.7 million new ordinary shares at 4.50 stg each.</p>
<p>Debonair said the offering would raise around 25 million stg. The company said Credit Lyonnais Securities, which is leading the offer, had received subscriptions for three times the number of shares on offer.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
